      "text": "These are my own synthesis notes, not official material. Based on **Building Custom Shops and UI for In-Island Transactions | Creating in Fortnite** — Epic Games livestream, published 26 August 2026 by **Fortnite Developers**. Watch the original: [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-C4X35-L2xo](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-C4X35-L2xo)"
